34
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:57,117
We will continue to fight.

35
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,137
We will continue to fight.

36
00:02:58,220 --> 00:03:05,117
We will continue to fight.

37
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:07,960
Fighting gold!

38
