But I need more, and more, and more.

48
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:01,637
Unless you want to fight the
big one, grow me some grass.

49
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:02,838
Grow like your life

50
00:04:05,140 --> 00:04:06,397
depends on it, Giorno.

51
