85
00:06:02,980 --> 00:06:04,100
No, not quite.

86
00:06:04,380 --> 00:06:06,557
We should be alright for
the time being, though.

87
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:09,157
The good news is, you
bought us a little time.

88
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:13,037
Our primary objective at this point
is getting what we need and escaping.

89
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:16,057
You can be sure the bastard won't
fall for the same strategy twice.

90
00:06:16,140 --> 00:06:18,860
So forget about him and go, Mista!

91
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:22,972
I'll crack that lion open like
a pinata and find the disc.

92
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:25,537
I'll snatch it up and get out of sight.

93
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:27,267
All I need is a few seconds.

94
00:06:27,820 --> 00:06:31,217
But will hiding be enough to
fool that winter wonder freak?

95
00:06:31,300 --> 00:06:33,397
There's a good chance that plan will work.

96
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,833
But what if it doesn't?

97
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:38,318
All I know for sure is this
guy isn't messing around.

98
00:06:38,580 --> 00:06:40,537
I don't want to think
about what'll happen if

99
00:06:40,620 --> 00:06:43,326
