Bucciarati and the others.

100
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,680
This deranged bastard needs to die!

101
00:06:46,140 --> 00:06:47,905
And there's no time, like now!

102
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:48,830
What the?

103
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,720
Mista, what are you doing?

104
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:54,137
I'll prove you're not as
invincible as you think you are.

105
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:59,161
When you're forced to cover yourself
head-to-toe in ice, how exactly do you breathe?

106
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:05,200
There, I'm sure of it.

107
00:07:05,420 --> 00:07:08,457
I hear the hiss of air coming
from the back of his neck.

108
00:07:08,540 --> 00:07:10,400
So that's how he's breathing.

109
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:14,137
Numbers one and two get into
position to flank this strunzel.

110
00:07:14,220 --> 00:07:16,700
And the rest, get ready to fly.

111
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:20,700
That nut job's looking here.

112
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:23,517
Watch out, he's gonna do
that ice thingy again.

113
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:26,817
No, the first thing on his
mind will be coming up for air.

114
00:07:26,900 --> 00:07:30,477
Once he surfaces, I'll blast
that blowhole with some bullets.

115
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,300
Ready or not, here he comes.

116
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,854
Let's go, six bullets.

117
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:36,314
We strike the moment he takes a breath.

118
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:42,305
Mista, numbers one and two are reporting
that they can't find the breathing hole.

119
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:44,571
It's how he's positioned!

120
00:07:44,660 --> 00:07:45,857
His head's angled up!

121
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:47,234
The opening's covered!

122
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:51,820
Shit, this plan's a non-starter!
Let's retrieve! Pipe down!

123
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:54,757
Break position and you
can forget about treats!

124
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,297
You got that one and two?

125
00:07:56,380 --> 00:08:00,260
You got some balls attacking
my forehead like that! Meester!

126
00:08:05,620 --> 00:08:06,900
What the hell?

127
00:08:07,340 --> 00:08:09,357
You were trying to shoot the fish?

128
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:12,100
What stupid idea are you concocting?

129
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:14,420
Yes, he looked down! There it is!

130
00:08:14,580 --> 00:08:15,920
All right, blast away!

131
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:19,340
Look sharp, we're gonna kill this!

132
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:27,240
One and done, it's time to run!

133
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,030
Huh?

134
00:08:33,820 --> 00:08:36,260
Hold on, what's that sound?

135
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,030
What?

136
00:08:38,113 --> 00:08:39,020
Don't tell me he's...

137
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:43,520
So, you figured out how I was
breathing and aim for that, eh?

138
00:08:44,220 --> 00:08:45,050
Mista?

139
