this and is risking his life.

169
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:12,957
But that's just the mindset needed
to light your path in this darkness.

170
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:15,158
This is when things get interesting.

171
00:10:15,300 --> 00:10:19,920
I've no doubt there will be sacrifices,
but Masa and I have determinazione.

172
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:21,800
We will find a way.

173
