What the actual hell?

174
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,077
They stuck the thing in here?

175
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:33,920
In a crevice of a statue?

176
00:10:34,900 --> 00:10:37,300
Damn it, I'm at point blank range.

177
00:10:37,860 --> 00:10:42,017
From right here, I should be able to
take out his breathing vent and more.

178
00:10:42,100 --> 00:10:44,877
If I can get close enough
to bypass his barrier.

179
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:45,860
This is bad.

180
00:10:46,260 --> 00:10:47,297
Mista is desperate.

181
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:50,968
This whole ordeal, he's prepared
to pay for it with his life.

182
00:10:51,060 --> 00:10:54,117
But this isn't simple grit
in the face of desperation.

183
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,500
He's saving us with Determinazione.

184
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,120
It's not martyrdom.

185
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:00,200
It's our road to victory.

186
00:11:00,640 --> 00:11:02,100
A computer disk?

187
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:05,797
Of course, that's what you dubious
bastards were after all along.

188
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:07,720
A clear path to the boss!

189
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:11,757
Now that I have this, the boss can
say goodbye to his secret identity!

190
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:15,000
All that's left now is to capture Trish.

191
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:17,651
But first, I gotta do away with you fools.

192
00:11:19,380 --> 00:11:21,020
Bring it, chuckle schmuck!

193
00:11:21,220 --> 00:11:24,420
I can't wait to put you
out of your misery! Mister!

194
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:35,913
What the hell do you think you're doing?

195
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:40,597
This is what it means
to have determination to

196
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:43,386
forge your path through
the darkness of light!

197
00:11:45,780 --> 00:11:49,980
Guido Mista, arrested at 17
on allegations of murder.

198
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:54,737
Despite the extenuating
circumstances surrounding the case,

199
00:11:54,820 --> 00:11:59,408
his self-defense plea was rejected and
he was sentenced to 30 years in prison.

200
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:04,417
I was actually happy before this.

201
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:06,680
Is this really happening?

202
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:11,997
Mista had always been able to see the bright
side of things, but for the first time,

203
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,300
he was truly scared.

204
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,070
Shit.

205
00:12:21,700 --> 00:12:23,320
Get up, you're free to go.

206
00:12:31,460 --> 00:12:34,180
Are you the one who did this? Yes.

207
00:12:34,500 --> 00:12:38,265
I saw your story on the news, and
I believe it was self-defense.

208
00:12:38,700 --> 00:12:40,171
Now, from what I've seen,

209
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:44,317
you're a top-notch gunman, and your
inner strength is even more formidable.

210
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:48,880
Besides, a guy like yourself wouldn't
last two years wasting away in prison.

211
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:50,497
That's why...

212
00:12:50,580 --> 00:12:52,937
Why you pulled some strings on my behalf.

213
00:12:53,020 --> 00:12:55,020
So let me guess, you're a mafioso?

214
00:12:55,880 --> 00:12:56,710
Come on.

215
00:12:57,400 --> 00:12:59,280
I know a great restaurante.

216
00:13:13,100 --> 00:13:14,957
Looks like you're enjoying that.

217
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:18,237
You should try the bruschetta if
you still have some room in there.

218
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:20,380
Of course. Mi scusi. Si?

219
00:13:20,900 --> 00:13:21,917
Bruschetta for him.

220
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,765
And the others too, I suppose.

221
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,120
Four bruschettas.

222
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:27,720
No, make it five.

223
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:30,494
I can't be the lone man out now, can I?

224
00:13:31,400 --> 00:13:32,230
Coming up.

225
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:36,340
Now, getting back to what
I was saying... I'll do it.

226
00:13:36,620 --> 00:13:38,757
I actually think we'd
make an awesome team.

227
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,605
That's why I'm agreeing to it.

228
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:43,440
But first, order me a Dallas, too.

229
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,700
Oh, and some Tarot alle fragole.

230
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:49,360
You really are an odd one, aren't you?

231
00:13:55,980 --> 00:13:57,417
Must be fate.

232
00:13:57,500 --> 00:13:59,060
Ha, could be worse.

233
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,849
I guess it all worked out.

234
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:06,200
Mista came to realize that each and every
person has their own unique destiny.

235
00:14:06,660 --> 00:14:09,425
And while youth tends to
be a difficult period,

236
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:11,894
filled with seemingly endless setbacks,

237
00:14:12,140 --> 00:14:16,258
in the end, one always travels down
the path they're destined to take.

238
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,030
There.

239
00:14:19,113 --> 00:14:20,540
The path is plain as day.

240
00:14:20,820 --> 00:14:23,408
I just have to follow
it to the finish line.

241
00:14:23,940 --> 00:14:25,560
I found it, Giorno!

242
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,857
I see it there, through the darkness.

243
00:14:27,940 --> 00:14:29,411
It's the path to victory!

244
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:47,920
It's like you idiots just
refuse to learn your lesson.

245
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:53,900
Or were you not listening when I told
you sub-zero temperatures freeze vapor?

246
00:14:54,260 --> 00:14:58,697
But if I were to take a frozen mass of
vapor and stuff it in my soup to melt down,

247
00:14:58,780 --> 00:15:01,477
then the vapor would return
to its original state.

248
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:03,736
And since that state's basically air,

249
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,419
I'm like a diver with a scuba tank.

250
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:10,920
I don't need a breathing vent to
take in oxygen. Huh? Look at the van!

251
00:15:11,060 --> 00:15:13,037
The guy deflected all six of the bullets!

252
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:15,257
How are we supposed to beat this bastard?

253
00:15:15,340 --> 00:15:19,460
But you have all that determination
going for you, right, Mista?

254
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:27,177
Say your goodbyes.

255
00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:30,360
My determination is unwavering, Giorno.

256
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:34,600
If you hadn't given me yours, I
would have never discovered my path.

257
00:15:34,780 --> 00:15:38,839
The enlightened path that led me to
shove myself with my own bullets.

258
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:44,450
What?

259
00:15:44,533 --> 00:15:45,500
I can't see.

260
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:47,497
The blood's congealed to my visor.

261
00:15:47,580 --> 00:15:50,497
Path through the murky
darkness wasn't going to reveal

262
00:15:50,580 --> 00:15:53,177
itself by blasting through
that protective ice wall.

263
00:15:53,260 --> 00:15:54,140
No, no.

264
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:58,000
The easier route was to splash
blood all over your ugly mug!

265
00:15:58,780 --> 00:16:00,280
I can't get it off!

266
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:05,977
Hey, it's the metal pole from earlier!

267
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:08,472
Nista, your bullet must have reshaped it!

268
00:16:11,020 --> 00:16:12,380
Shit, that hurts!

269
00:16:12,780 --> 00:16:13,956
What's this feeling?

270
00:16:14,140 --> 00:16:17,160
Something warm and wet is
trickling down my back!

271
00:16:17,700 --> 00:16:20,800
A moment ago, you asked
if I had determinazione.

272
00:16:21,940 --> 00:16:26,920
Well, I'm gonna show you what it's all
about, but you gotta do the same for me.

273
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,977
Let me see just how determined you are to

274
00:16:30,060 --> 00:16:32,707
be shot into the proverbial
hell frozen over.

275
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:35,786
This bastard's still upright.

276
00:16:35,940 --> 00:16:39,058
What's worse, he's trying
to shove me back even more.

277
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:41,240
This lunatic is gonna kill me.

278
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:44,260
Merida, I gotta hurry
and yank this thing out.

279
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:50,220
Stop it!

280
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:51,557
The bullet will come back!

281
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:53,464
You won't survive another blow!

282
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:54,840
I have no choice.

283
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:57,296
That's what it means to have resolve.

284
00:16:57,380 --> 00:16:59,851
Now buckle up, bullets, and hold on tight!

285
00:17:05,360 --> 00:17:07,140
It's not over till it's over!

286
00:17:07,360 --> 00:17:08,740
White Ice gently weeps!

287
00:17:17,940 --> 00:17:19,640
It's too much, Mista!

288
00:17:19,900 --> 00:17:21,420
You're gonna pass out!

289
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,647
Think about what that means!

290
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:24,980
We'll fade away!

291
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:26,380
No, not yet!

292
00:17:26,620 --> 00:17:28,937
I've still got some
fight left in this body!

293
00:17:29,020 --> 00:17:30,726
I can still pull the trigger!

294
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:36,740
Yeah, we won!

295
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:38,842
That's the way you got him good!

296
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:41,520
You're wrong, you fools!

297
00:17:44,180 --> 00:17:49,320
Fine, you may have determinazione,
but I've got even more, guido mister.

298
00:17:51,500 --> 00:17:54,280
I have to say, you dole
out some major damage.

299
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:56,060
Kudos to you, amigo.

300
00:17:57,200 --> 00:18:01,220
However, losing all that blood
was actually to my advantage.

301
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:05,860
I froze the blood you forced out of
me and created my own icy support.

302
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:10,137
It keeps that pesky spike from sinking
further into my neck, so I'm good to go.

303
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:12,926
You won't beat me that
easily, you understand?

304
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:15,560
Oh, by the way, did you forget?

305
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:18,200
You still have a final bullet in play.

306
00:18:20,420 --> 00:18:22,740
That's now in your skull! I win!

307
00:18:25,120 --> 00:18:26,200
There's no wound?

308
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:35,810
Mista.

309
00:18:37,260 --> 00:18:38,460
Your determination.

310
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:42,000
It shines even brighter
than the morning sun.

311
00:18:42,320 --> 00:18:44,144
It's showed us the way forward.

312
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:47,220
And it's put us on the
path toward tomorrow.

313
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:49,660
We've won because of you.

314
00:18:49,860 --> 00:18:51,260
What the hell?

315
00:19:11,180 --> 00:19:15,740
I'm finally starting to realize
something about this Giorno Giovanna.

316
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:21,560
He's a total rookie, but even so,
when he says something will happen,

317
00:19:21,860 --> 00:19:24,140
it eventually comes to fruition.

318
00:19:24,800 --> 00:19:28,440
My Determinazione was really Giorno's.

319
00:19:28,740 --> 00:19:32,100
It flooded my being without
me even realizing it.

320
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:35,900
It's like he superseded
Bucciarati to become Cape,

321
00:19:36,120 --> 00:19:38,120
like he was guiding my every move.

322
00:19:38,660 --> 00:19:40,440
How the hell does he do that?

323
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,332
Guess it doesn't matter.

324
00:19:42,540 --> 00:19:45,187
Not like obsessing over
it won't do any good.

325
00:19:48,860 --> 00:19:49,700
Hey, Mista.

326
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:51,220
We did it, huh?

327
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:52,301
We got the disc.

328
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:53,780
All thanks to you.

329
00:19:54,420 --> 00:19:55,517
Yeah, that's great.

330
00:19:55,600 --> 00:19:57,237
But could you please heal me?

331
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:58,150
I'm dying.

332
00:19:58,233 --> 00:20:02,817
I was only able to do all that because I
knew you could fix me up after the battle.

333
00:20:02,900 --> 00:20:06,280
Come on, before I bite the
big one, heal me up already.

334
00:20:07,740 --> 00:20:08,957
Right away.

335
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:11,257
But first, I should probably clarify.

336
00:20:11,340 --> 00:20:13,297
Golden Wind doesn't really fix things.

337
00:20:13,380 --> 00:20:17,204
It creates parts I can add to you,
so there'll be new body parts.

338
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:19,677
I'll imbue the bullets in you with life,

339
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:22,157
replacing your damaged
blood vessels and tissue.

340
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:24,122
Great, just get started, please.

341
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:25,777
Oh, and there's one more thing.

342
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:27,617
Since I'm not actually healing your body,

343
00:20:27,700 --> 00:20:30,465
you're still gonna have
a bit of residual pain.

344
00:20:32,740 --> 00:20:33,740
What the hell?

345
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:35,717
Do you have to be so rough, Giorno?

346
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:36,837
Take it easy, Ande.

347
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:37,750
I'm injured.

348
00:20:37,860 --> 00:20:40,197
I already told you
there's nothing I can do.

349
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:43,160
Settle down and take it
like a mafioso. Besides,

350
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:48,087
there's about 18 more to go, and you'll
have to strip if you want this to work.

351
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,270
Bucciarati!

352
00:20:52,353 --> 00:20:53,820
I'm picking up two people.

353
00:20:54,100 --> 00:20:56,257
It doesn't look like there's anyone else.

354
00:20:56,340 --> 00:20:57,575
Proceed with caution.

355
00:20:58,460 --> 00:21:00,989
My guess is, you've
found Mista and Giorno.

356
00:21:01,180 --> 00:21:04,945
I'm sure the lack of excitement
has them longing for our return.

357
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:06,470
Giorno!

358
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:08,020
There they are! Mista!

359
00:21:08,380 --> 00:21:10,040
Stop doing it so hard!

360
00:21:10,280 --> 00:21:12,020
I leave my damn clothes on!

361
00:21:12,140 --> 00:21:13,140
It's too intense!

362
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:17,310
Narancia?

363
00:21:17,393 --> 00:21:18,300
Did you find them?

364
00:21:20,900 --> 00:21:21,730
Why?

365
00:21:21,813 --> 00:21:22,877
No, but...

366
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:26,217
There's something in my eyes! Giorno!

367
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:28,497
It's so hard to see in
this early morning light.

368
00:21:28,580 --> 00:21:29,917
I'll keep after it, though.

369
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:31,588
It's not so rough, damn it.

370
00:21:56,300 --> 00:21:59,837
I don't give a damn about nothing else.

371
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:03,397
Freaking you is all I need!

372
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:07,980
I need your body.

373
00:22:10,600 --> 00:22:12,957
Tonight you got my time.

374
00:22:13,040 --> 00:22:19,337
Tonight you

375
00:22:19,420 --> 00:22:20,337
won't be sad?

376
00:22:20,420 --> 00:22:22,980
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

377
00:22:23,260 --> 00:22:26,060
You got my mind.

378
00:22:26,360 --> 00:22:29,660
You got my mind.

379
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:31,720
All I want to do is free.

380
00:22:32,220 --> 00:22:34,380
You must not say.

381
00:22:34,600 --> 00:22:35,860
Oh, tell me.

382
00:22:36,100 --> 00:22:37,877
What must I do?

383
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:39,220
What must I do?

384
00:22:39,820 --> 00:22:44,640
To show how much I'm going to free.

385
00:22:45,780 --> 00:22:46,610
Yeah.

386
00:22:47,020 --> 00:22:48,657
You must not say.

387
00:22:48,740 --> 00:22:52,317
Tell me what you must not do.

388
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:54,577
Tell me what you must not do.

389
00:22:54,660 --> 00:22:59,040
Tell me what you must
not do. I'm freaking.

390
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:10,540
Risotto, you bastard.

391
00:23:11,820 --> 00:23:13,700
So you're coming to Venice.

392
00:23:19,220 --> 00:23:22,640
I'm sure Bucciarati and his
men will take care of you.

393
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:26,460
Come what may, peace is at hand.

394
00:23:51,820 --> 00:23:54,360
Thank you.
